      "content": "it's just not that simple though. people say \"take it one step at a time\" but what if there isn't even a path left? i look at my work and it's just... hollow. i feel like a fraud. every day i wake up and i'm just waiting for the moment everyone realizes i've got nothing left to give. it's exhausting. i just want the noise to stop.",
